+/**
+ * Open the legacy store and flush the WAL into the main file with
+ * `PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)`. Idempotent: on non-WAL stores the
+ * checkpoint is a no-op (SQLite returns busy=0,log=-1,checkpointed=-1).
